  "raw_output": "{\n  \"exercis_type\": \"CEFR Englis_Placement Test\",\n  \"section_id\": 5,\n  \"section_title\": \"Reading Comprehension\",\n  \"cefr_range\": \"B2-C1\",\n  \"reading_text\": \"\\\\\nIn the bustling city of New York, a young entrepreneur named Alex has recently launched an innovative app that is transforming local travel experiences. The app, called 'Travelocity,' allows users to book and manage their trips with just a few taps on their smartphones. Alex's vision was simple: create an all-inclusive platform that connects travelers directly with local businesses, providing personalized recommendations and enhancing the overall tourist experience.\\\\\nThe app has quickly gained popularity among both locals and visitors alike, thanks in part to its user-friendly interface and comprehensive features. Users can now easily find the best restaurants, museums, and attractions without having to rely on traditional guides or expensive tour operators. Moreover, Travelocity has made it possible for small businesses, such as local artisans and independent hotels, to reach a wider audience and attract more customers.\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 36,\n      \"question\": \"What is the main purpose of Travelocity?\",\"\n      \"options\": [\n        \"A) To provide a comprehensive list of local attractions.\",\n        \"B) To connect travelers directly with small businesses in New York City.\",\n        \"C) To offer personalized tourist experiences through a mobile app.\",\n        \"D) To promote local artisans and independent hotels on social media platforms.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"C\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 37,\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following statements is true about Travelocity? \",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"A) It operates as a traditional tour operator.\",\n        \"B) Users cannot book accommodations through the app.\",\n        \"C) The app primarily targets international tourists only.\",\n        \"D) It aims to enhance local businesses' reach and customer base.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"D\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\n      \"question\": \"What feature of Travelocity makes it unique compared to traditional guides?\",\"\n      \"options\": [\n        \"A) It provides detailed information about local restaurants.\",\n        \"B) Users can book accommodations directly with the app's partners.\",\n        \"C) The app offers personalized recommendations based on user preferences.\",\n        \"D) It allows users to virtually explore New York City's attractions.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"C\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"According to the passage, what benefits does Travelocity offer small businesses?\",\"\n      \"options\": [\n        \"A) It helps them increase sales by reaching a wider customer base.\",\n        \"B) The app guarantees that all small businesses will become popular tourist destinations.\",\n        \"C) Travelocity directly manages and promotes these businesses on its platform.\",\n        \"D) Small businesses can only use the app to book accommodations.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"A\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"What can be inferred about Alex's app from the passage?\",\"\n      \"options\": [\n        \"A) It is a complete replacement for traditional tourist guides.\",\n        \"B) The app's success has led to the closure of many local businesses.\",\n        \"C) Alex believes that Travelocity will soon become a global travel hub.\",\n        \"D) The app's success has helped both large and small businesses in New York City.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"D\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
